termsAppUseBody:
The customer shall use the app solely for personal and lawful use.

It is not permitted to:
• misuse the app;
• circumvent security measures;
• provide false information;
• use the services for unlawful purposes.

Fat7i reserves the right to take appropriate measures in the event of misuse.

termsBookingsBody:
5.1 Requesting a ride
A customer can request a ride via the Fat7i app by entering the necessary information, including:
• pick-up location;
• destination;
• number of passengers;
• number of pieces of luggage;
• any additional information or requests.

5.2 Confirmation of the booking
A booking is only definitively confirmed once:
• the required information has been correctly entered;
• payment has been successfully processed.
The customer receives a confirmation via the app.

5.3 Changing a booking
The customer may make changes within 5 minutes of placing the booking to:
• pick-up location;
• destination;
• number of passengers;
• number of pieces of luggage;
• other booking details.
After this period, changes are no longer possible via the app. If the customer wishes to make changes after this period, this is only possible by cancelling the ride in accordance with the applicable cancellation policy.

5.4 Additional stops
The customer can add multiple intermediate stops while booking. New intermediate stops cannot be automatically added during the ride. Additional stops that were not specified during the booking are not mandatory for the driver. If the driver agrees to an additional stop or waiting time, waiting charges may apply.
